#: app/er_policies/active_check.py:30
msgid "Active check"
msgstr "Aktiv-koll"

#: app/er_policies/active_check.py:32
msgid ""
"All users who're registered as active and have the potential voter role will "
"be added when a poll starts. If group voting is used, the votes will be "
"equally distributed among the active members of that group."
msgstr ""

#: app/er_policies/auto_always.py:31
msgid "Automatic always"
msgstr "Alltid automatisk"

#: app/er_policies/auto_always.py:33
msgid ""
"This method will always create a new electoral register when potential "
"voters change. It will even change electoral register for ongoing polls, so "
"use this with caution!"
msgstr ""

#: app/er_policies/auto_before_poll.py:25
msgid "Automatic before poll"
msgstr "Automatiskt före omröstning"

#: app/er_policies/auto_before_poll.py:27
msgid ""
"Any users with potential voter status will be added to the electoral "
"register when a poll starts."
msgstr ""

#: app/er_policies/group_votes_before_poll.py:36
msgid "Votes from groups"
msgstr "Röster från grupper"

#: app/er_policies/group_votes_before_poll.py:38
msgid ""
"Groups have a total vote count which can be distributed among members that "
"have the potential voter role. New electoral registers will be created "
"whenever a poll starts if needed."
msgstr ""

#: app/er_policies/manual.py:20
msgid "Manual only"
msgstr "Bara manuellt"

#: app/er_policies/manual.py:22
msgid ""
"No electoral registers will be created at all, you have to do it yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: app/er_policies/presence_check.py:27
msgid "Closing a presence check will set a new electoral register."
msgstr "En ny röstlängd skapas när en närvarokontroll avslutas."

#: app/er_policies/presence_check.py:29
msgid ""
"Any user who's both present and has the potential voter role will be added "
"to the electoral register. If group votes is activated, the votes will be "
"distributed equally between present members."
msgstr ""

#: app/polls/combined_simple.py:23 app/polls/simple.py:22
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ja"

#: app/polls/combined_simple.py:23 app/polls/simple.py:22
